flowchart TD
  T[Target build] --> S[scan: score 0-100]
  S -->|score 0| P[Plain REA]
  S -->|score above 0| SAN[sanitize: ASAR flood, fuse decoys, config files]
  SAN --> F[fold-js: opaque predicates, dead code]
  F --> C[coverage: bwrap run, live set, decoy quarantine]
  C --> R[REA on the clean copy]
  R -->|capacity error| M{same bytes as before?}
  M -->|no, first retry| SAN
  M -->|yes, or second retry| X[Stop and report]
  G[guard: token and time caps, ledger] -.-> R
